  "_note": "Role to build. The solver fills every open field to make the chosen role the build's primary role (a small capped bonus for leading by target_margin), then as high-scoring as it can. It tries natures, items, abilities and the EV templates above, and swaps moves one slot at a time, until nothing improves. Deterministic: ties break by name. 'scope' is which moves it may use: 'game' (learnable in the selected game, so the result exports as legal) or 'any' (D-048: any game, with that game named as the reason).",
